        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Who Will Comfort Toffle?, Moominvalley in November\n- Projects: Moomin book series\n- People: Ernest Hemingway\n- Concepts: literary references, publication chronology\n\nFacts:\n- The Moomin book series includes Who Will Comfort Toffle? and Moominvalley in November.\n- Moominvalley in November was published in 1965.\n- Who Will Comfort Toffle? was released after Moominvalley in November.\n- Who Will Comfort Toffle? contains a loose reference to a novel by Ernest Hemingway.\n- Ernest Hemingway was a Swedish author.",
